                "text": "We\u2019re in the middle of a cost-of-living crisis and if Congress lets the Affordable Care Act tax credits expire, Long Islanders who rely on them would see their monthly health care premiums spike by 32%. We can\u2019t let families get priced out of the care they need.\n\nhttps://t.co/dqq8oLId65",
